            <span><i class="fas fa-route"></i> 5 km from Resort</span>
            <span><i class="fas fa-clock"></i> 1 - 2 Hours</span>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 24px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;">1. Tip-in-Top (Tiffin Top) Viewpoint</h3>
          <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 18px;">
            Situated at the highest point in Lansdowne (approx. 1,700 meters above sea level), Tip-in-Top offers breathtaking 360-degree panoramic views of the snow-capped Garhwal peaks and deep valleys. It is the most popular sunrise and sunset spot in Lansdowne.
