          <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 18px;">
            Bhulla Tal is a serene man-made lake dedicated to the young Garhwali soldiers ('Bhulla' meaning younger brother in Garhwali) of the Garhwal Rifles. Surrounded by oak trees, it features paddle boating, a duck enclosure, a bamboo bridge, a children's park, and a lovely herbal garden cafe.
          </p>
          <div style="background: #f8fafc; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #22c55e; font-size: 13px; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 20px;">
